  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your truck is the projectile. Drive down the wide slope and up the real
    curved launch ramp. Speed, entry line and direction determine the flight. Adjacent
    competitors can physically jostle and collide in the air. No automatic scoring
    trajectory is supplied. Small wings unfold after leaving the lip. Limited aftertouch
    nudges the path and gently pitches, banks and yaws the wings; release forward/back
    once to arm range correction. Total correction is bounded; gravity always remains
    downward. ACTION dives once: wings fold, lift ends and descent becomes heavier.
    The same controls, grip, momentum, aftertouch and dive apply to AI.


    After
    the target is touched, propulsion and aftertouch end. Let the trucks bounce,
    slide, tumble or rest upside down. Points lock only after every remaining truck
    is supported and stable for1.8 continuous seconds:10outer,25middle,50precision,100tiny
    bullseye. Movement resets settling. A later fall into actual lava is zero; touching
    a high-value ring does not bank it. Sixty seconds of genuine persistent motion
    resolves zero, never the initial contact. Missed approaches and true world escapes
    have separate bounded recovery.


    Five launches each; total points win. Tied
    leaders receive equal-opportunity extra launches until resolved. Solo stores
    a personal best. Starts rotate; wind, target layout and moving precision sections
    are shared by everyone in a round. Later rounds increase visible wind and slowly
    move the precision zone. Each human keeps an independent stable chase pane; AI-only
    uses a broadcast. Once all resolve, a shared actual-motion replay offers angle,
    speed, rewind and skip. Pause/reconnect preserves bodies, attempts and scores;
    release and freshly confirm after source replacement. Offline only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
